      "sourceTextSha256": "f351fc59088b6ee7b9d99483062eee041c6de542b06a022ce59394615e254031",
      "text": "The amazing diversity of Brazil in one journey. It begins in Rio de Janeiro with the world-famous Carnival at the Sambadrome, where Brazil’s greatest samba schools compete through the night, then Sugar Loaf, Christ the Redeemer on Corcovado and the golden beaches of Brazil’s most beautiful city. Next come the thundering Iguazu Falls from the Brazilian and Argentine sides, a jungle lodge in the Amazon with piranha fishing and a night walk, and a finale on the tropical coast of Búzios.",
